# ============================================================
# exclude.list — File Exclusion Patterns for transfer.sh
#
# One pattern per line. Blank lines and lines starting with
# '#' are ignored. Inline comments (after a value) are also
# stripped before matching.
#
# Matching is performed against the BASENAME of each file
# (not the full path). Matching is case-sensitive.
#
# Supported pattern formats:
#   *.ext         — match by file extension
#                   e.g. *.tmp  matches  dump.sql.gz.tmp
#   filename.ext  — exact filename match
#                   e.g. debug.log  matches  debug.log only
#   prefix_*      — wildcard prefix match
#                   e.g. backup_*  matches  backup_2024.tar.gz
#   *substring*   — substring match
#                   e.g. *partial*  matches  db_partial_restore.sql
#   *             — matches any character(s) including dots
#   ?             — matches any single character
#
# Examples (uncomment to activate):
# ============================================================

# --- Incomplete / temporary transfer files ---
*.tmp
*.partial
*.crdownload
*.part

# --- Editor and system lock files ---
*.swp
*.swo
*.lck
*.lock

# --- Specific filenames to never transfer ---
# DONOTTRANSFER.sql
# debug.log
# error.log

# --- Archive staging patterns ---
# *_staging.*
# *_wip.*